{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33212","headline":"郡楼望九华歌 · 霍总","name":"郡楼望九华歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼上坐见九子峰，翠云赤日光溶溶。\n有时朝昏变疎密，八峰和烟一峰出。\n有时风卷天雨晴，聚立连连如弟兄。\n阳乌生子偶成数，丹凤养雏同此名。\n日日遥看机已静，未离尘躅思真境。\n子明龙驾腾九垓，陵阳相对空崔嵬。\n玉浆瑶草不可见，自有神仙风马来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"霍总","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}